DESCRIPTION:Grade 12 PE / Health Period 3\n\n地点安排带有条件，
 请按原公告核对，不能视为无条件更换教室。\n12年级体
 育/健康课第3节：Block 1开始。请确认你选择了正确的Block
 。参加体育Block需要携带并更换运动服装，健康Block则不
 需要。具体地点请查看健身室外的白板通知。\n\n公告原
 文：\nGrade 12 PE / Health Period 3 Hello class. Here is your October ca
 lendar. This will help guide you to the location we will be in for the mos
 t part. If things change i will try and notify you and remember the locati
 ons are also posted on the white board outside of the Fitness Room. Rememb
 er BLOCK 1 starts Friday October 9th. If you have selected this you need t
 o be in the correct block. Remember at Blocks you need to CHANGE for them 
 so make sure you have your change of clothes ready. The only ones you don'
 t are the Health Blocks. Thx Mr. D Ditter Grade 12 Period 3 Oct 2026.pdf 6
 6.24 KB PDF File
